1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"></font>

2
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"></font>

3
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kaki narase sonzai wo</b></font></font></font>

4
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>rock away your existence</b></font></font></font>

5
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>koko ni iru to</b></font></font></font>

6
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>shouting that you are here</b></font></font></font>

7
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:11,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>arata na tabi ga ima hajimaru</b></font></font></font>

8
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:11,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>a new journey begins now</b></font></font></font>

9
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kawari yuku kisetsu no naka wo ikinuku tabi ni bokura</b></font></font></font>

10
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>as we survived through the changing seasons</b></font></font></font>

11
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>chie to tsuyosa wo te ni ireta kedo JUST LOOKS LIKE SURVIVAL GAME</b></font></font></font>

12
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we gained knowledge and strength (just looks like a survival game)</b></font></font></font>

13
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>nagareteku jikan no naka ni</b></font></font></font>

14
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but the forgotten memories</b></font></font></font>

15
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>okizari ni shita omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

16
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>of the feelings abandoned within the flows of time</b></font></font></font>

17
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>wasureta koto sura wasurete ita</b></font></font></font>

18
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>have also been lost</b></font></font></font>

19
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kuzure kaketa toki kodoku wo shitte</b></font></font></font>

20
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>when sinking down we learned loneliness</b></font></font></font>

21
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>deaeta bokura hitori ja nai</b></font></font></font>

22
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but now we've met each other we are no longer alone</b></font></font></font>

23
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>sarake dase kanjou wo banjou no omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

24
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>unveil your feelings those high emotions</b></font></font></font>

25
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>namidame ga unmei wo kaete yuku</b></font></font></font>

26
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>those tears will change your fate</b></font></font></font>

27
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>yami ni uchi narase kodou wo</b></font></font></font>

28
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>pound your heartbeat against the darkness</b></font></font></font>

29
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kitto aeru yo onaji itami no hata no moto de</b></font></font></font>

30
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we're sure to meet under the same flag of pain</b></font></font></font>

31
00:01:35,860 --> 00:01:40,830
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Missing the Point</font>

32
00:01:35,860 --> 00:01:40,830
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Target is Coming Into View</font>

33
00:01:41,410 --> 00:01:43,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, Choji, gather all of them!</font>

34
00:01:44,620 --> 00:01:45,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know!</font>

35
00:01:46,710 --> 00:01:47,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

36
00:01:50,590 --> 00:01:51,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

37
00:01:53,380 --> 00:01:55,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pick it up! Pick it up!</font>

38
00:01:55,340 --> 00:01:57,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Over here!</font>

39
00:01:57,260 --> 00:01:59,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Over there!</font>

40
00:01:59,260 --> 00:02:01,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't lose any of them!</font>

41
00:02:01,220 --> 00:02:03,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

42
00:02:03,140 --> 00:02:05,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pick it up!</font>

43
00:02:05,060 --> 00:02:06,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Over there!</font>

44
00:02:07,060 --> 00:02:08,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go over there!</font>

45
00:02:08,980 --> 00:02:10,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey that's mine!</font>

46
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:13,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Partial Expansion Jutsu!</font>

47
00:02:13,690 --> 00:02:14,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Arm!</font>

48
00:02:17,990 --> 00:02:19,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where did that bird go?</font>

49
00:02:24,790 --> 00:02:26,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! We lost it!</font>

50
00:02:28,670 --> 00:02:29,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Over there!</font>

51
00:02:33,340 --> 00:02:34,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just a little more...</font>

52
00:02:38,090 --> 00:02:40,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a mission believe it or not!</font>

53
00:02:44,390 --> 00:02:46,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is something very important...</font>

54
00:02:46,930 --> 00:02:51,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I beg you...
Please let go of it!</font>

55
00:02:54,690 --> 00:02:56,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have trouble, Tsunade-sama!</font>

56
00:02:56,780 --> 00:02:57,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?!</font>

57
00:02:57,990 --> 00:02:59,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those papers
scattered throughout the village,</font>

58
00:02:59,490 --> 00:03:01,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">are the plans that were stolen
from the carpenter boss.</font>

59
00:03:02,620 --> 00:03:05,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Currently, Shikamaru and his team
have finished collecting all the plans,</font>

60
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and rechecking them.</font>

61
00:03:07,750 --> 00:03:09,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it seems like they have
collected all of them.</font>

62
00:03:10,370 --> 00:03:11,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is the meaning of this?</font>

63
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have no idea...</font>

64
00:03:13,380 --> 00:03:14,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama! We have a report</font>

65
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:16,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from those who headed to
the Hidden Waterfall Village!</font>

66
00:03:17,550 --> 00:03:18,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Was there movement?!</font>

67
00:03:19,380 --> 00:03:23,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Actually, it turns out that it was only
a large-scale practice run!</font>

68
00:03:24,220 --> 00:03:27,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They are saying that they see
no signs of an invasion of Leaf Village.</font>

69
00:03:27,930 --> 00:03:28,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

70
00:03:29,060 --> 00:03:30,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems as though they have
already finished their practice run,</font>

71
00:03:30,770 --> 00:03:33,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the Hidden Waterfall Village
is back to normal.</font>

72
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:37,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So Genno and Hidden Waterfall Village
have nothing to do with each other...?</font>

73
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:40,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Disengage the S-Level
Emergency Security Alert!</font>

74
00:03:41,450 --> 00:03:43,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Order all forces back to village!</font>

75
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:45,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes!</font>

76
00:03:46,330 --> 00:03:49,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What in the world
was that man plotting?!</font>

77
00:04:00,300 --> 00:04:01,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama!</font>

78
00:04:01,420 --> 00:04:02,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What now?!</font>

79
00:04:04,930 --> 00:04:06,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The body that
the ANBU Black Ops gathered...</font>

80
00:04:07,050 --> 00:04:08,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's...</font>

81
00:04:09,850 --> 00:04:11,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not Genno...?</font>

82
00:04:13,900 --> 00:04:15,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What does that mean?</font>

83
00:04:15,690 --> 00:04:18,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I thought that Old Man Genno was
cornered by the ANBU Black Ops</font>

84
00:04:19,030 --> 00:04:20,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and blew himself up.</font>

85
00:04:20,490 --> 00:04:25,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He traded places with a corpse that
he had ready right before the explosion...</font>

86
00:04:25,990 --> 00:04:27,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's a huge possibility!</font>

87
00:04:28,580 --> 00:04:29,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're in the middle of confirming that!</font>

88
00:04:30,450 --> 00:04:33,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Their appearances look similar,
but small details bring up questions!</font>

89
00:04:37,920 --> 00:04:40,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Most likely, it's another man.</font>

90
00:04:41,090 --> 00:04:43,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you telling me
he fooled the ANBU Black Ops?</font>

91
00:04:44,760 --> 00:04:46,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That means, Genno is...</font>

92
00:04:47,010 --> 00:04:49,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's still alive!</font>

93
00:04:49,930 --> 00:04:53,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! What is that man up to?</font>

94
00:05:08,530 --> 00:05:11,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Over there. Behind that tree.</font>

95
00:05:16,620 --> 00:05:17,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's here!</font>

96
00:05:20,710 --> 00:05:25,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see. The old man Genno used
this hole to get away.</font>

97
00:05:26,380 --> 00:05:27,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He camouflaged it well.</font>

98
00:05:28,470 --> 00:05:31,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it wasn't for the Byakugan,
we would have missed it.</font>

99
00:05:32,560 --> 00:05:33,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not only that...</font>

100
00:05:34,430 --> 00:05:37,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This hole is made so that it closes
naturally by the weight of the earth.</font>

101
00:05:38,690 --> 00:05:40,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we came here another day later,</font>

102
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:41,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it would have been
extremely difficult to find,</font>

103
00:05:41,860 --> 00:05:43,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even with the Byakugan.</font>

104
00:05:45,650 --> 00:05:46,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And to prove that,</font>

105
00:05:46,650 --> 00:05:50,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you can barely see any sign of
an entrance to this hole.</font>

106
00:05:51,030 --> 00:05:53,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru, can you follow his scent?</font>

107
00:05:59,330 --> 00:06:01,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's even got getting rid of
his smell covered...</font>

108
00:06:03,460 --> 00:06:05,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where could he have gone?</font>

109
00:06:13,430 --> 00:06:14,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our conclusion is that...</font>

110
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:18,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Old Man Genno is still alive</font>

111
00:06:18,230 --> 00:06:20,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and there's a possibility that
he's hiding in Leaf Village.</font>

112
00:06:22,730 --> 00:06:25,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He got cornered,
and faked his own suicide,</font>

113
00:06:25,230 --> 00:06:27,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and stole the plans so that he could...</font>

114
00:06:27,320 --> 00:06:30,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">make all of us turn our eyes outside
of the village.</font>

115
00:06:32,280 --> 00:06:34,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He could have already known
about the big practice run</font>

116
00:06:34,950 --> 00:06:38,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in the Hidden Waterfall Village
and used that to his advantage.</font>

117
00:06:40,120 --> 00:06:45,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the ANBU Black Ops
started to mark Genno because</font>

118
00:06:45,460 --> 00:06:48,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they happened to find out that his letter
of recommendation was a fake, right?</font>

119
00:06:49,840 --> 00:06:51,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Was it a coincidence...?</font>

120
00:06:51,930 --> 00:06:56,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't it strange that
a real letter of recommendation was</font>

121
00:06:56,930 --> 00:07:00,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">at the house of the carpenter boss
he worked for?</font>

122
00:07:02,400 --> 00:07:04,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then what is his true goal?</font>

123
00:07:05,400 --> 00:07:08,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we knew the answer to that,
we wouldn't be struggling so much...</font>

124
00:07:08,990 --> 00:07:09,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru!</font>

125
00:07:10,660 --> 00:07:11,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The only thing I can say now is...</font>

126
00:07:12,570 --> 00:07:16,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The number of Shinobi in this village
currently is at its lowest ever.</font>

127
00:07:17,540 --> 00:07:21,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We only have a bare minimum
of us here!</font>

128
00:07:22,500 --> 00:07:25,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And most of their eyes are
looking outside of the village.</font>

129
00:07:26,090 --> 00:07:30,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if Genno was walking around
as he was humming on the streets,</font>

130
00:07:30,420 --> 00:07:32,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">no one would suspect anything of him.</font>

131
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:34,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did he set a trap in the village?!</font>

132
00:07:35,390 --> 00:07:38,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could the fact that
he scattered the plans around mean</font>

133
00:07:38,180 --> 00:07:40,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he's already done setting his trap?</font>

134
00:07:40,890 --> 00:07:46,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, this is just a diversion
to turn our eyes.</font>

135
00:07:47,020 --> 00:07:50,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We can't leave this place
without any security,</font>

136
00:07:50,320 --> 00:07:52,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but we have few people...</font>

137
00:07:52,860 --> 00:07:55,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then where do we look?</font>

138
00:07:56,410 --> 00:07:57,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Academy.</font>

139
00:07:57,790 --> 00:07:58,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Academy?</font>

140
00:07:59,330 --> 00:08:02,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why the Academy out of all
the important facilities in the village?</font>

141
00:08:03,420 --> 00:08:05,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Out of all the sites Genno worked on,</font>

142
00:08:05,580 --> 00:08:08,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">only the Academy's repair plan
was stolen.</font>

143
00:08:09,260 --> 00:08:11,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's hard to think that
it was a coincidence</font>

144
00:08:12,050 --> 00:08:13,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for it to disappear at this timing.</font>

145
00:08:21,850 --> 00:08:22,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

146
00:08:35,820 --> 00:08:36,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well?</font>

147
00:08:38,160 --> 00:08:39,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's nothing in this room.</font>

148
00:08:41,540 --> 00:08:43,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then... move ahead to the next room.</font>

149
00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:45,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

150
00:08:52,970 --> 00:08:54,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seems like there's nothing in this area.</font>

151
00:08:55,430 --> 00:08:58,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can't you look at
the entire campus at once?</font>

152
00:08:59,220 --> 00:09:01,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And we have Hinata too, you know?</font>

153
00:09:01,680 --> 00:09:04,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That would be possible
if we know what the target was,</font>

154
00:09:04,730 --> 00:09:07,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but we're looking for
something suspicious.</font>

155
00:09:08,020 --> 00:09:09,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll have to take the basic route.</font>

156
00:09:10,400 --> 00:09:11,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Wait a minute!</font>

157
00:09:12,030 --> 00:09:13,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're in the way!</font>

158
00:09:14,740 --> 00:09:17,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And there's too many... people here.</font>

159
00:09:18,820 --> 00:09:20,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like I said!</font>

160
00:09:20,740 --> 00:09:24,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All I want is for you guys to come outside
even just for a moment!</font>

161
00:09:24,660 --> 00:09:29,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our teacher told us to study on our own
in the classroom for today!</font>

162
00:09:30,040 --> 00:09:32,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We can't go out of the room!</font>

163
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:36,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are no teachers today!</font>

164
00:09:36,880 --> 00:09:38,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So nobody would know
if you left the class!</font>

165
00:09:39,970 --> 00:09:43,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We used to skip class when
Iruka-sensei wasn't looking</font>

166
00:09:43,930 --> 00:09:46,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when we were younger.</font>

167
00:09:46,520 --> 00:09:48,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, a delinquent!</font>

168
00:09:48,310 --> 00:09:52,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Delinquent!</font>

169
00:09:52,780 --> 00:09:55,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have to check this area!</font>

170
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:59,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides, all the teachers have gone
on a mission to protect the village.</font>

171
00:10:00,030 --> 00:10:02,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you guys still here?</font>

172
00:10:02,660 --> 00:10:04,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They must be useless.</font>

173
00:10:04,620 --> 00:10:08,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say?!
We're also protecting the village too...</font>

174
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:11,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto. You're wasting time</font>

175
00:10:12,380 --> 00:10:13,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's crush them!</font>

176
00:10:13,630 --> 00:10:14,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

177
00:10:14,880 --> 00:10:16,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Expansion Jutsu!</font>

178
00:10:24,680 --> 00:10:26,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're going to tell on you to our teacher!</font>

179
00:10:26,430 --> 00:10:27,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, do as you please!</font>

180
00:10:28,230 --> 00:10:29,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot!</font>

181
00:10:30,560 --> 00:10:32,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's practice our Kunai Knives.</font>

182
00:10:32,520 --> 00:10:33,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sounds good.</font>

183
00:10:39,160 --> 00:10:41,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't seem like
there's anything suspicious...</font>

184
00:10:45,790 --> 00:10:47,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up!</font>

185
00:10:48,460 --> 00:10:49,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

186
00:10:54,550 --> 00:10:58,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on.
I'm begging you to leave!</font>

187
00:10:59,300 --> 00:11:00,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

188
00:11:01,010 --> 00:11:06,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where did those kids from
the next classroom go?</font>

189
00:11:07,060 --> 00:11:08,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know...</font>

190
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:10,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They were going to practice
their Kunai Knives.</font>

191
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:11,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what they were saying.</font>

192
00:11:13,310 --> 00:11:15,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, yeah, yeah. That's right.</font>

193
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:19,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're practicing their Kunai Knives
in a place like that?</font>

194
00:11:25,490 --> 00:11:26,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll do next.</font>

195
00:11:26,540 --> 00:11:27,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ok. Do your best!</font>

196
00:11:27,660 --> 00:11:28,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do it!</font>

197
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:30,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

198
00:11:31,370 --> 00:11:33,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, so close.</font>

199
00:11:39,590 --> 00:11:40,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They really are practicing...</font>

200
00:11:41,590 --> 00:11:44,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When we were
students at the Academy,</font>

201
00:11:44,180 --> 00:11:46,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we used to skip class and come here.</font>

202
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:53,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The teachers couldn't find us here,
it really was great!</font>

203
00:11:54,900 --> 00:11:57,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I read manga, and took naps...</font>

204
00:11:57,570 --> 00:11:59,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right, I ate potato chips.</font>

205
00:12:00,360 --> 00:12:01,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, that's no good!</font>

206
00:12:02,570 --> 00:12:03,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can learn something from those kids.</font>

207
00:12:04,990 --> 00:12:06,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if the teachers don't see you,</font>

208
00:12:06,830 --> 00:12:08,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you should still commit to your practice!</font>

209
00:12:09,410 --> 00:12:11,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're true models of students!</font>

210
00:12:13,120 --> 00:12:16,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wonderful!
I'm excited! I'm moved!</font>

211
00:12:16,920 --> 00:12:19,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd like to take class with them!</font>

212
00:12:21,420 --> 00:12:23,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We wouldn't want to interrupt.
Let's go.</font>

213
00:12:24,430 --> 00:12:25,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

214
00:12:25,930 --> 00:12:26,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

215
00:12:27,390 --> 00:12:28,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

216
00:12:28,430 --> 00:12:30,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did they have that before?</font>

217
00:12:41,070 --> 00:12:42,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to get this one!</font>

218
00:12:47,530 --> 00:12:49,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ouch!</font>

219
00:12:51,160 --> 00:12:53,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I had it!</font>

220
00:12:54,210 --> 00:12:56,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems pretty new.</font>

221
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:58,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Genno could have made it...</font>

222
00:12:59,840 --> 00:13:03,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to get Neji or Hinata!</font>

223
00:13:04,930 --> 00:13:07,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys get out of the way.</font>

224
00:13:08,640 --> 00:13:10,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're getting in the way of our practice.</font>

225
00:13:10,640 --> 00:13:12,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I'm sorry!</font>

226
00:13:13,560 --> 00:13:14,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm next!</font>

227
00:13:16,730 --> 00:13:17,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

228
00:13:24,860 --> 00:13:27,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a Paper Bomb!
It's hidden behind the wall!</font>

229
00:13:28,160 --> 00:13:30,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What, inside the wall?!</font>

230
00:13:30,950 --> 00:13:32,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's completely hidden inside the wall.</font>

231
00:13:33,330 --> 00:13:37,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But then how do you
detonate it...?</font>

232
00:13:38,460 --> 00:13:39,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, there she is.</font>

233
00:13:41,460 --> 00:13:43,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Hinata!</font>

234
00:13:44,420 --> 00:13:45,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto.</font>

235
00:13:45,720 --> 00:13:46,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

236
00:13:48,430 --> 00:13:50,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata, go out with me!</font>

237
00:13:51,760 --> 00:13:56,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you saying
at a time like this?!</font>

238
00:13:58,560 --> 00:14:03,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know... Go out with you?</font>

239
00:14:04,690 --> 00:14:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You won't?</font>

240
00:14:05,860 --> 00:14:08,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not necessarily saying no...</font>

241
00:14:14,790 --> 00:14:17,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I'll just ask Neji then.
See you later!</font>

242
00:14:18,330 --> 00:14:19,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

243
00:14:25,300 --> 00:14:27,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a thin thread attached
to the Paper Bomb.</font>

244
00:14:27,800 --> 00:14:28,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A thread?</font>

245
00:14:29,010 --> 00:14:32,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's probably a special thread
used to ignite it.</font>

246
00:14:33,060 --> 00:14:35,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's probably is going to detonate it
from a distance...</font>

247
00:14:36,140 --> 00:14:38,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where is that thread connected to?!</font>

248
00:14:50,660 --> 00:14:52,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It goes around the classroom and...</font>

249
00:14:55,080 --> 00:14:57,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It goes outside...
towards the training hall...?</font>

250
00:15:00,120 --> 00:15:01,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a log standing...</font>

251
00:15:04,880 --> 00:15:06,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This... Could it be?!</font>

252
00:15:10,260 --> 00:15:12,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji! Come with me for a second!</font>

253
00:15:12,720 --> 00:15:15,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it!
We're in the middle of something...</font>

254
00:15:15,260 --> 00:15:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Actually there's a strange log standing
in the training hall over there.</font>

255
00:15:18,680 --> 00:15:19,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We wanted him to check it.</font>

256
00:15:21,730 --> 00:15:22,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the triggering device!</font>

257
00:15:28,030 --> 00:15:30,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Try loosening up your shoulders
and then throw it.</font>

258
00:15:30,900 --> 00:15:32,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up.</font>

259
00:15:32,530 --> 00:15:34,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, I'm up next.</font>

260
00:15:37,160 --> 00:15:38,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There should be a target on the log.</font>

261
00:15:39,080 --> 00:15:40,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, there is.</font>

262
00:15:40,410 --> 00:15:42,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The center of the target
is the triggering device!</font>

263
00:15:45,920 --> 00:15:48,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When a Kunai Knife hits the center...</font>

264
00:15:48,260 --> 00:15:49,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the device will activate...</font>

265
00:15:50,670 --> 00:15:51,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the Academy will explode!</font>

266
00:15:53,390 --> 00:15:54,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So close!</font>

267
00:15:55,260 --> 00:15:57,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you focus, you'll hit the target.</font>

268
00:15:59,060 --> 00:16:01,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, I'm going to hit this time.</font>

269
00:16:05,230 --> 00:16:06,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Focus...</font>

270
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:08,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And target!</font>

271
00:16:08,690 --> 00:16:10,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't let anybody hit the target!</font>

272
00:16:24,370 --> 00:16:25,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, I hit the target!</font>

273
00:16:27,840 --> 00:16:28,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You did it!</font>

274
00:16:31,010 --> 00:16:32,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh?</font>

275
00:16:34,010 --> 00:16:40,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The tip is cracked. You always
have to take care of your tools.</font>

276
00:16:41,270 --> 00:16:44,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn, I thought that I hit the target.</font>

277
00:16:45,060 --> 00:16:46,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This way! Behind there!</font>

278
00:16:47,860 --> 00:16:51,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right...
I'm going to hit it for sure!</font>

279
00:16:51,650 --> 00:16:52,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the spirit!</font>

280
00:16:56,450 --> 00:16:57,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This looks good!</font>

281
00:16:58,280 --> 00:16:59,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time I'm going to hit it!</font>

282
00:17:01,040 --> 00:17:02,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bushy Brow!</font>

283
00:17:02,370 --> 00:17:03,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it, Lee!</font>

284
00:17:06,210 --> 00:17:07,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

285
00:17:12,760 --> 00:17:14,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, did I scare you?</font>

286
00:17:15,130 --> 00:17:18,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry. I just dropped my ninja tool...
Here.</font>

287
00:17:26,730 --> 00:17:28,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bushy Brow, you did it!</font>

288
00:17:30,150 --> 00:17:31,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I had the target!</font>

289
00:17:32,110 --> 00:17:33,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why did you get in the way?!</font>

290
00:17:34,030 --> 00:17:36,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be quiet!
If that had hit the target,</font>

291
00:17:36,860 --> 00:17:38,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Academy would have exploded!</font>

292
00:17:38,570 --> 00:17:39,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

293
00:17:40,030 --> 00:17:41,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For real?</font>

294
00:17:49,750 --> 00:17:51,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A triggering device in here, huh?</font>

295
00:17:52,750 --> 00:17:55,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When something hits the center,
the Academy explodes.</font>

296
00:17:56,630 --> 00:18:00,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So there hasn't been anyone
who's been able to hit the center.</font>

297
00:18:00,930 --> 00:18:03,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We really were lucky.</font>

298
00:18:03,850 --> 00:18:05,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We were lucky, huh?</font>

299
00:18:07,060 --> 00:18:11,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So who started to practice
throwing their Kunai Knife here?</font>

300
00:18:12,570 --> 00:18:14,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who? Who was it?</font>

301
00:18:15,490 --> 00:18:16,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Somebody told us that we'd be praised</font>

302
00:18:16,900 --> 00:18:19,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if we got better at Kunai Knife throwing
in secret from the teachers.</font>

303
00:18:20,160 --> 00:18:22,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"In secret from from the teachers..."</font>

304
00:18:23,490 --> 00:18:28,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whoever must have used Genjutsu
to make them think that.</font>

305
00:18:28,500 --> 00:18:29,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It must be Genno.</font>

306
00:18:36,920 --> 00:18:37,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened?</font>

307
00:18:39,130 --> 00:18:45,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... There's more than one thread
coming out of the triggering device.</font>

308
00:18:46,480 --> 00:18:47,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that true, Hinata?</font>

309
00:18:48,520 --> 00:18:49,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

310
00:18:53,400 --> 00:18:54,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

311
00:18:57,900 --> 00:19:00,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">True. There's not just one...</font>

312
00:19:02,370 --> 00:19:04,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Two... no, three?</font>

313
00:19:06,160 --> 00:19:07,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where are they connected to?</font>

314
00:19:09,790 --> 00:19:12,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Outside of the Academy... No!</font>

315
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:15,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait! It's hard to see from here.</font>

316
00:19:17,380 --> 00:19:19,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me too...</font>

317
00:19:42,360 --> 00:19:43,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

318
00:19:43,740 --> 00:19:44,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

319
00:19:58,840 --> 00:19:59,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I found one.</font>

320
00:20:06,050 --> 00:20:07,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I found one, too</font>

321
00:20:07,720 --> 00:20:08,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tell us the location.</font>

322
00:20:09,640 --> 00:20:12,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, wait.
The thread splits again.</font>

323
00:20:17,320 --> 00:20:18,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Over here too...</font>

324
00:20:31,160 --> 00:20:32,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is...</font>

325
00:20:33,370 --> 00:20:34,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way...</font>

326
00:20:35,920 --> 00:20:36,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be...</font>

327
00:20:37,420 --> 00:20:40,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! What's the matter!</font>

328
00:20:40,920 --> 00:20:44,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's Paper Bombs planted
all over the village!</font>

329
00:20:45,430 --> 00:20:47,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not just 10 or 20...</font>

330
00:20:48,930 --> 00:20:51,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's countless numbers of them!</font>

331
00:20:51,890 --> 00:20:53,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

332
00:20:55,100 --> 00:20:58,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Village Hidden in the Leaves
is a nest of Paper Bombs!</font>

333
00:21:29,780 --> 00:21:32,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">hoshikuzu suchasucha sucha odoru</font></font></b></font></font>

